{%- comment -%}
  The three-up service band — port of components/home/service-band.tsx.

  Rules top and bottom, a camel mark in a circle, then the promise and its detail.

  DEVIATION — the type ratio, and the band colour. The design set the promise at
  --text-label (12) uppercase and its own subordinate detail at --text-caption
  (14), so the hierarchy ran backwards, and put a 52px disc beside the 12px line.
  The promise is now --text-h3 (20, interface face per the system's type table,
  which sets H3 and below in Poppins) and loses `uppercase tracking-nav`: it is a
  sentence, not a label. The disc comes down to 36px with a 20px mark so it stays
  subordinate to the line it decorates.

  The band is `bg-canvas`. Cream is the design's declared band colour and this is
  one of only two places it is used as an actual band; it is also the tonal step
  down from the espresso voices wall directly above. Cream-on-cream is the trap
  here: the disc was `bg-inert` (#f7f1ec) and the dividers `divide-hairline`
  (#f2ece6), both of which disappear against cream (#fbf4ef). The disc is
  therefore `bg-surface` (white) and the dividers `divide-line` (#dfd0c4) — the
  boundary token every other cream-filled control in the theme already uses.
  The section rule top and bottom stays `border-rule`, which reads on white.

  Each promise must be stated elsewhere on the site — that is the reason this band
  is allowed where the made-to-order one is not. The shipping threshold is the
  announcement bar's, the exchange is on every product page, and fit advice over
  WhatsApp is what the customer reviews describe the studio doing. A fourth
  promise nobody keeps makes this band the same problem the made-to-order block
  was.

  `icon` selects a mark from snippets/icon.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="mt-section border-y border-rule bg-canvas">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-content px-gutter">
    <ul class="grid divide-y divide-line md:grid-cols-3 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        <li class="flex min-h-30 items-center justify-center gap-4.5 px-4 py-6 md:min-h-45 md:py-8" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <span class="inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-pill bg-surface text-brand">
            {% render 'icon', icon: block.settings.icon, class: 'size-5' %}
          </span>
          <span class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-h3 leading-h3 font-medium text-ink">
              {% render 'copy', value: block.settings.title, label: 'promise', inline: true %}
            </span>
            <span class="text-caption text-ink-muted">
              {% render 'copy', value: block.settings.body, label: 'detail', inline: true %}
            </span>
          </span>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Service band",
  "max_blocks": 3,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Only put a promise here that is stated somewhere else on the site. A claim that lives only in this band is a claim nobody has to keep." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "service",
      "name": "Promise",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Mark",
          "options": [
            { "value": "shipping", "label": "Shipping" },
            { "value": "support", "label": "Support" },
            { "value": "exchange", "label": "Exchange" }
          ],
          "default": "shipping"
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Promise" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "body", "label": "Detail" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Service band",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "service", "settings": { "icon": "shipping", "title": "Free shipping", "body": "On orders over Rp 750.000" } },
        { "type": "service", "settings": { "icon": "support", "title": "Studio support", "body": "Fit advice over WhatsApp" } },
        { "type": "service", "settings": { "icon": "exchange", "title": "Easy exchange", "body": "One free swap in 14 days" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
